# W2a — explicit Triton fused-MoE backend for the FP8 experts.
# E0.3 (2026-09-03): with DeepGEMM E8M0 on, triton_deep_gemm_moe._select_experts_impl
# picks DeepGEMM for EVERY M, decode included (M=4-24 tokens per verify step); upstream's
# own "N <= 512 -> fall back to Triton for further speed-up" rule never fires because the
# E8M0 check short-circuits it. This arm forces the Triton path for all shapes (prefill
# included: watch the 30k/100k numbers, Triton has no tuned config for GB10 yet — W2c
# adds one under node/moe-configs/). Linear FP8 layers stay on DeepGEMM.
# Rollback: ./tp4ctl restart without TP4_ENV (~22 min).
EXTRA_VLLM_ARGS="--kv-cache-memory=17179869184 --moe-backend triton"
